# Re-exclude nested private/cache files even within allowed source directories.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.env*
**/secrets.toml
**/*.pdf
**/*.doc
**/*.docx
**/*.dotx
**/*.odt
**/*.pptx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xltx
**/uploads/
**/documents/
**/data/
**/reports/
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.jsonl
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.parquet
**/*.gguf
**/*.safetensors
